{
  "project_info": {
    "project_id": "epub_20260223_234817",
    "original_file": "C:\\Users\\韩顺成\\Desktop\\测试用\\『負けヒロインが多すぎる！５』購入特典 BOOK☆WALKER限定ショートストーリー(小学館)(2023))_译文.epub",
    "created_at": "2026-02-23T23:48:17.552335",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-23T23:48:17.552335"
  },
  "content_mappings": {
    "line_000001": {
      "original_text": "『負けヒロインが多すぎる！５』購入特典 BOOK☆WALKER限定ショートストーリー",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 1,
      "chapter_id": "Text/navigation-documents.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000002": {
      "original_text": "表紙",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 2,
      "chapter_id": "Text/navigation-documents.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000003": {
      "original_text": "桃园中学3年2班 学号17号",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 3,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000004": {
      "original_text": "※本SS包含剧透，请先阅读正文后再行欣赏。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 4,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000005": {
      "original_text": "市立桃园中学。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 5,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000006": {
      "original_text": "在书架前站了一会儿的我，鼓起劲再次伸出手。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 6,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000007": {
      "original_text": "曾以为会永远持续下去的义务教育，也只剩下一年了。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 7,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000008": {
      "original_text": "也就是说，这之后的出路必须由自己来选择——",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 8,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000009": {
      "original_text": "我一边重新扣好学生制服外套的挂钩，一边浏览着书架上排列的文件夹。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 9,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000010": {
      "original_text": "文件夹的书脊上列着市内各所高中的名字。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 10,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000011": {
      "original_text": "我在其中找到了“爱知县立石蕗高等学校”的名字，伸出了手。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 11,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000012": {
      "original_text": "然而，我在中途停住了伸出的手，犹豫着又放下了。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 12,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000013": {
      "original_text": "——我退缩了。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 13,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000014": {
      "original_text": "石蕗高中是市内首屈一指的升学强校。说实话，以我现在的成绩很勉强。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 14,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000015": {
      "original_text": "在涉及内申书的高中入学考试中孤注一掷地赌一把逆袭，我还没那么浪漫主义。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 15,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000016": {
      "original_text": "我在架子前站了一会儿，然后一鼓作气，再次伸出手去。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 16,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000017": {
      "original_text": "这就好比买一本封面有点H的轻小说。虽然完全是普通的书但有什么问题吗？——我抱着这种感觉伸手去拿。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 17,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000018": {
      "original_text": "就在指尖触碰到文件夹书脊的同时，从旁边伸出来的一只手碰到了我的指尖。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 18,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000019": {
      "original_text": "“啊，抱歉。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 19,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000020": {
      "original_text": "我慌忙把手缩了回来。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 20,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000021": {
      "original_text": "“我才是——咦，你是我们班的同学吧？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 21,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000022": {
      "original_text": "“呃，嗯，算是吧……”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 22,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000023": {
      "original_text": "没错，和我同时伸手去拿同一份文件的，是同班同学烧盐柠檬。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 23,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000024": {
      "original_text": "她小麦色的肌肤和充满活力的短发，在教室里也格外引人注目。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 24,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000025": {
      "original_text": "她看了看我，又看了看那份文件，",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 25,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000026": {
      "original_text": "“哦——你要考蕨吹高中啊。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 26,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000027": {
      "original_text": "说着便拿起文件，直接递给了我。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 27,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000028": {
      "original_text": "“诶，可是——”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 28,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000029": {
      "original_text": "“我没关系啦，我还会再学一会儿的。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 29,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000030": {
      "original_text": "她把文件塞给愣住的我，然后刷地一下转过身去。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 30,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000031": {
      "original_text": "裙摆轻轻扬起，一缕柑橘系的清香飘来，搔弄着我的鼻尖。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 31,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000032": {
      "original_text": "我有多久没和女生说过话了？",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 32,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000033": {
      "original_text": "我呆呆地望着她离去的背影，直到掌中文件的触感将我的意识拉了回来。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 33,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000034": {
      "original_text": "现在可不是盯着女生看的时候。我在角落的桌子旁坐下，打开了文件。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 34,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000035": {
      "original_text": "——蕨吹高中历史悠久，其前身是江户时代吉田藩的藩校。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 35,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000036": {
      "original_text": "据说校园面积大得离谱，还从国家那里获得了各种名头，是一所很厉害的学校。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 36,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000037": {
      "original_text": "第一页学校概况里写的偏差值，比我的全国模拟考成绩高出一个小学生的年龄。至于是几年级的小学生，这是个秘密。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 37,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000038": {
      "original_text": "从现在开始努力的话，到考试前总会有办法的吧——。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 38,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000039": {
      "original_text": "“唉，不行吧。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 39,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000040": {
      "original_text": "一边叹气一边抬头看向天花板。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 40,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000041": {
      "original_text": "虽说才刚升上三年级，但周围的人也都要开始认真准备升学考试了。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 41,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000042": {
      "original_text": "只是普通地努力的话，能维持现状就不错了。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 42,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000043": {
      "original_text": "……说起来，烧盐同学也要考这里来着。那个人，成绩有那么好吗。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 43,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000044": {
      "original_text": "环顾四周，在远处的桌子旁看到了烧盐的身影。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 44,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000045": {
      "original_text": "烧盐好像是田径部的队长，在校内的公告栏上也经常看到她的名字。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 45,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000046": {
      "original_text": "光是田径部的训练就很辛苦了吧，居然还在空闲时间学习。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 46,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000047": {
      "original_text": "正带着一种混杂着羡慕和自卑的心情看着，一个戴眼镜的男学生在她旁边坐下了。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 47,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000048": {
      "original_text": "……原来如此，是和男朋友一起学习啊。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 48,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000049": {
      "original_text": "带着百分之百的自卑感，把视线移回文件夹上。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 49,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000050": {
      "original_text": "石蕗高中的社团活动也很活跃。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 50,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000051": {
      "original_text": "翻看着社团活动介绍的页面，目光停在了文艺部的介绍上。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 51,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000052": {
      "original_text": "活动时间是每天放学后。活动内容只有一句话：“以世界为目标”。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 52,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000053": {
      "original_text": "……这个，根本就是啥也不干的社团吧。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 53,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000054": {
      "original_text": "不过，这种比较宽松的正好。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 54,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000055": {
      "original_text": "要是为了比赛每天练习什么的，也太辛苦了。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 55,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000056": {
      "original_text": "“但是文艺部的比赛，比什么呢……？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 56,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000057": {
      "original_text": "不由得自言自语道。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 57,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000058": {
      "original_text": "是比诗歌或者短歌吗？我只会读读轻小说，要不就当个经理什么的……。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 58,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000059": {
      "original_text": "一边沉浸在妄想中一边站起身，把文件放回书架。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 59,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000060": {
      "original_text": "不管怎么说，不提高成绩的话一切都无从谈起。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 60,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000061": {
      "original_text": "要说自己有没有那份决心，老实说还没有。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 61,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000062": {
      "original_text": "……总之先把决定往后推推，今天还是去借书的续集吧。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 62,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000063": {
      "original_text": "在小说区拿到的是《灭国之战记》第8卷。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 63,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000064": {
      "original_text": "上一卷里揭露了主人公是某国王位继承者，故事一下子变得精彩起来。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 64,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000065": {
      "original_text": "说起来在家看这个的时候，佳树好像挺感兴趣的。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 65,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000066": {
      "original_text": "要不把第1卷也借走吧，这么想着便随手朝书架伸出了手。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 66,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000067": {
      "original_text": "“……嗯？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 67,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000068": {
      "original_text": "那一瞬间，我感觉到视线而回过头去。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 68,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000069": {
      "original_text": "一个小小的影子“唰”地躲到了书架后面。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 69,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000070": {
      "original_text": "难道说——是佳树？",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 70,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000071": {
      "original_text": "妹妹佳树是同在桃园中学的一年级生，刚入学时明明是在学校却总黏着我不放。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 71,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000072": {
      "original_text": "不过最近她在学校里不怎么露面了，我倒是稍微松了口气。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 72,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000073": {
      "original_text": "想要追刚才那个影子，我停下了脚步。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 73,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000074": {
      "original_text": "再怎么说，也不至于有人会跟踪自己住在一起的家人吧。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 74,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000075": {
      "original_text": "“我是不是也保护过度了啊”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 75,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000076": {
      "original_text": "苦笑着只拿了第8卷，朝借书柜台走去。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 76,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000077": {
      "original_text": "途中经过烧盐他们那桌附近时，听到了窃窃私语。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 77,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000078": {
      "original_text": "“真的假的！？波义耳-查理定律不是社会科教科书上的内容吗？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 78,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000079": {
      "original_text": "“嗯——硬要说的话，算是理科课吧。你看，前几天不是把气体温度和压力的关系整理到笔记本上了吗？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 79,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000080": {
      "original_text": "……这对话是怎么回事。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 80,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000081": {
      "original_text": "我斜眼偷瞄过去，看见两个人正脸贴着脸凑在一起看一本笔记本。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 81,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000082": {
      "original_text": "“啊——……是这边的‘夏尔先生’啊。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 82,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000083": {
      "original_text": "“对，就是这个‘夏尔先生’。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 83,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000084": {
      "original_text": "说完，两人对视了一瞬，然后压低声音哧哧地笑了起来。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 84,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000085": {
      "original_text": "……很好，爆炸吧。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 85,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000086": {
      "original_text": "我快步走向借阅柜台，从包里拿出《灭国战记》第7卷，和准备借的第8卷一起放在台上。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 86,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000087": {
      "original_text": "“那个，这个，还书和借书……”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 87,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000088": {
      "original_text": "我小声嘟囔着，原本在看书的图书委员慢慢抬起了头。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 88,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000089": {
      "original_text": "是个戴着眼镜、打扮朴素的女学生，放学后偶尔会在柜台看到她。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 89,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000090": {
      "original_text": "图书委员不甘示弱似的，也小声嘟囔着拿起了书。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 90,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000091": {
      "original_text": "她和图书管理员老师不一样，不会主动搭话，真是帮大忙了——。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 91,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000092": {
      "original_text": "“……你在看《灭国战记》吗？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 92,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000093": {
      "original_text": "“诶？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 93,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000094": {
      "original_text": "图书委员的眼镜“唰”地反了下光，她抬眼看向我。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 94,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000095": {
      "original_text": "“春日野遥老师很棒对吧！《灭国战记》在遥老师的作品里虽然比较冷门，但我觉得是最高杰作！你读到第几卷了——啊，是读到第7卷对吧，我在说什么呀。第8卷最后卡洛斯战死的那段超级催泪的，请快点读哦！”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 95,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000096": {
      "original_text": "……这人，气场好强。而且，还若无其事地剧透。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 96,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000097": {
      "original_text": "图书委员正要再开口，一个熟悉的声音插了进来。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 97,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000098": {
      "original_text": "“兄长大人，真巧啊。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 98,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000099": {
      "original_text": "一边说着一边现身的，是我的妹妹佳树。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 99,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000100": {
      "original_text": "“果然在啊。那刚才的是——”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 100,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000101": {
      "original_text": "“不，佳树是刚刚才到的哦。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 101,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000102": {
      "original_text": "干脆地断言后，佳树带着一副对外人用的笑脸，探头看向柜台里面。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 102,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000103": {
      "original_text": "“不好意思，《HOLO SEN》的第7卷还回来了吗？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 103,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000104": {
      "original_text": "回过神来的图书委员眨了眨眼，然后点了点头。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 104,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000105": {
      "original_text": "“啊，是的。嗯，刚刚还回来。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 105,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000106": {
      "original_text": "图书委员慌慌张张地开始办理手续。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 106,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000107": {
      "original_text": "“咦，佳树你也在看啊。这个很有趣吧？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 107,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000108": {
      "original_text": "“不，我没在看。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 108,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000109": {
      "original_text": "“……诶？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 109,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000110": {
      "original_text": "那为什么要借第7卷啊。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 110,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000111": {
      "original_text": "正觉得奇怪，佳树就紧紧地抱住了我的胳膊。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 111,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000112": {
      "original_text": "“因为如果紧跟在哥哥大人后面借的话，借书卡上的名字就能排在一起了呀。姓氏也一样，这不就几乎跟夫妻一样了吗？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 112,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000113": {
      "original_text": "不，这个逻辑很奇怪。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 113,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000114": {
      "original_text": "我正想反驳，佳树笑眯眯地抬头看着我。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 114,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000115": {
      "original_text": "“很像夫妻，对吧？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 115,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000116": {
      "original_text": "连妹妹的气场都这么强。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 116,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000117": {
      "original_text": "“嗯，这个嘛……还是兄妹更自然吧？毕竟还是初中生。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 117,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000118": {
      "original_text": "我含糊地敷衍着回答，这时手续好像办完了。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 118,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000119": {
      "original_text": "图书委员的女学生把书放在柜台上。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 119,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000120": {
      "original_text": "“给，这是第7卷。然后这个嘛——（小声嘀咕嘀咕嘀咕）”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 120,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000121": {
      "original_text": "女学生一边小声嘀咕着，一边用指尖把第8卷推了过来。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 121,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000122": {
      "original_text": "……突然感觉被拒之千里之外了。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 122,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000123": {
      "original_text": "我暗自有点受打击，离开了图书室。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 123,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000124": {
      "original_text": "佳树依然缠着我的胳膊，心情很好地跟我搭话。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 124,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000125": {
      "original_text": "“哥哥，今天是在查什么资料吗？平时的话，放学后借了书就会马上回家的。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 125,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000126": {
      "original_text": "“倒也算不上是查资料啦。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 126,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000127": {
      "original_text": "我一边说着，一边低头看着佳树那如丝绢般的黑发。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 127,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000128": {
      "original_text": "“——佳树，你有想去的（高中）学校吗？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 128,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000129": {
      "original_text": "面对这突如其来的问题，佳树眨了眨她圆圆的眼睛。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 129,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000130": {
      "original_text": "“有！当然是有哥哥在的高中啦！”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 130,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000131": {
      "original_text": "我就知道她会这么说。我叹了口气，告诫她。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 131,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000132": {
      "original_text": "“佳树。这是你自己的事，必须认真考虑升学方向才行。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 132,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000133": {
      "original_text": "“嗯——，但是佳树才一年级嘛。想走的路也还没决定好呢。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 133,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000134": {
      "original_text": "嘛，也是这么回事。说到底，我这个三年级生都还没完全定下目标学校呢。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 134,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000135": {
      "original_text": "就这么沉默地走着，佳树小声嘀咕了一句。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 135,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000136": {
      "original_text": "“……对‘石蕗’（高中），稍微有点憧憬呢。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 136,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000137": {
      "original_text": "这句带着点顾虑的话不知为何让我心里在意起来，我决定再去读一读关于石蕗高中的资料。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 137,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000138": {
      "original_text": "◇　　◇　　◇　　◇",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 138,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000139": {
      "original_text": "——然后我成了高中生，不知为何穿着以前的制服走在桃园中学里。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 139,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000140": {
      "original_text": "正要经过图书室前时，我瞬间停下了脚步。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 140,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000141": {
      "original_text": "“温水同学，图书室怎么了吗？”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 141,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000142": {
      "original_text": "走在旁边的朝云同学疑惑地眨了眨亮晶晶的眼睛。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 142,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000143": {
      "original_text": "“啊，不，没什么。比起这个，我们快去园艺部吧。校舍后面应该是往这边……”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 143,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000144": {
      "original_text": "我正要径直往前走，朝云同学却抓住了我的手臂。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 144,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000145": {
      "original_text": "“那边只有洗手台哦。来，是这边。”",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 145,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000146": {
      "original_text": "被朝云同学拉着走，我回想起了当时的事。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 146,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000147": {
      "original_text": "——佳树憧憬着石蕗。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 147,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000148": {
      "original_text": "我是在初三时知道这件事的，正好就是在这个地方。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 148,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000149": {
      "original_text": "如果自己去了别的学校，佳树会不会放弃石蕗而追过来——",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 149,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000150": {
      "original_text": "我就是这么想的，才硬着头皮以石蕗为目标。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 150,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000151": {
      "original_text": "……说不定，这只是我的自作多情呢。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 151,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000152": {
      "original_text": "对这突然掠过的想法，我慌忙摇了摇头。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 152,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000153": {
      "original_text": "对佳树来说，喜欢男生还太早。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 153,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000154": {
      "original_text": "园艺部就在前面了。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 154,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    },
    "line_000155": {
      "original_text": "我加快脚步，超过朝云同学，匆匆向前走去——。",
      "translated_text": "",
      "line_number": 155,
      "chapter_id": "Text/p-001.xhtml",
      "translated_at": ""
    }
  }
}